#31123
The Fortress~
You pass thru the gates into a large town-sized courtyard.  Everyone one you
see seems to be hurrying towards the east and there is a sense of excitement in
the air!  Narrow straw and mud-strewn streets criss-cross each other in the
area surrounding this vast stone ediface.  Peddler's cries punctuate the air as
they try to sell to these people who all seem in a rush to get somewhere.  
It's as if some great race were about to start!    
~
